{"type":"sorting","title":"Calibration exercise — Where does AI actually help?","intro":"Ten minutes. This is the most important exercise in the module.

Below are fifteen tasks a People team might plausibly hand to an LLM. Sort each into **does this well**, **does this partly — needs verification**, or **does this badly — don't**.

Nothing reveals until all fifteen are committed — an unscored guess teaches nothing."}
